	<subsubsection>
		<title>Metacognitive Reflection</title>
		<activity>
		<title>Light Bulb Model</title>
		
		
		<statement><p></p>
			<p>
				You built a model for circuits this week, based on the brightness of light bulbs.  Restate the model here in your own words, and explain why you cannot use Ohm's law for real lightbulbs.
			</p>
		</statement>
		</activity>
	</subsubsection>
	
